  m_Text: Triple Chance is a very simple wheel game; there are 3 wheels namely the
    outer wheel, middle wheel and inner wheel. Each wheel has numbers 0-9 randomly
    placed at equal intervals. In every game the 3 wheels are rotated in opposite
    direction and when all the wheels come to halt the result is displayed and the
    payout is calculated.
